GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Architecture> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Architecture> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Architecture> ;
    narr:childCount "5"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "c324d9ce6d9b082dca4993288c0089a61adc2155" ;
    narr:narration """This hub consolidates the operational governance framework for system deployment, anchored by the requirement that [release deploys are gated behind a signed manifest](narr:Narrative_DeploymentGateBySignedManifest). The current trajectory emphasizes a shift toward formal, authority-ranked protocols, as evidenced by a series of [decision-oriented probes](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) that prioritize conservation and competence. These [technical and formal assessments](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3) suggest a hardening of the deployment pipeline, moving away from trust-based shipping toward verifiable, signed checkpoints. The thematic span covers the intersection of concrete, realis-based deployment mechanics and abstract governance requirements, maintaining a consistent, calm-positive affect across all current expressions. While the [current operational posture](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5) remains focused on rigid adherence to these gates, the underlying tension remains whether this architecture will scale or if the [technical abstraction](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4) of these gates will necessitate future bypasses or re-evaluations of accountability.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_DeploymentGateBySignedManifest> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "release deploys are gated behind a signed manifest, not shipped on trust" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_DeploymentGateBySignedManifest> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Tension between concrete, realis-based deployment steps and abstract governance requirements." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Potential for future bypasses of the signed-manifest gate despite current formal adherence." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_DeploymentGateBySignedManifest> ] ;
    narr:writer "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite" .
}